  "bodyHash": "720c26856b493ed3",
  "content": "<h2><strong>關於</strong></h2>\n<p>Arts &amp; Crafts 主要為創意模式和生存模式中的建築添加了各種獨特的建築方塊！&nbsp; 該模組由 KekeCreations 和 Arbeet 開發！&nbsp; 我們將持續更新此模組以適配新版本！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_da9cd1cd-65a6-4193-85ee-55c3bba1a3d3.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>兼容性</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Arts &amp; Crafts V1.3.0</strong> 提供了一個<strong>配置選項來禁用需要大量兼容性的功能</strong>，例如染色花盆或染色裝飾花盆。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>在 Arts &amp; Crafts V1.3.0 中，染色裝飾花盆現在可以與任何陶片配合使用！</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>如果您正在尋找不同模組與 Arts &amp; Crafts 之間的兼容性支持</strong>，您可以下載 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artsandcrafts-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arts &amp; Crafts Compatibility</a>！</p>\n<p>如果您希望在自己的模組中為畫筆添加兼容性支持，您可以參考<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkekecreations.boomla.net%252fmods%252fminecraft-java-edition%252farts-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的網站</a>上的文檔了解具體操作！&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; <img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_b38592c3-a7cc-4fe8-a654-a38e70f9214e.png\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_46654742-e7f0-4eeb-a776-1897f1625b2f.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>功能</strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_da5b20ee-a039-4ea8-8816-66dfa7577fc0.png\"><br></strong></h2>\n<p>如果您想了解本模組功能的更多詳細信息，請查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkekecreations.boomla.net%252fmods%252fminecraft-java-edition%252farts-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡的維基</a>！&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>粉筆</li>\n<li>粉筆棒</li>\n<li>軟木</li>\n<li>染色花盆</li>\n<li>石膏</li>\n<li>蓮花</li>\n<li>畫筆</li>\n<li>彩繪泥磚</li>\n<li>灰泥</li>\n<li>瓦片</li>\n<li>皂石</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_6b87bc64-2f00-4f70-9c04-94fb99d2fbf7.png\"></p>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>特別感謝 <strong>ExDrill</strong> 製作了畫筆塗抹音效並設置了畫筆數據包相關內容！ [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fExDrill_\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>]</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fOther_Goblin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Goblin</a> 建議添加彩繪泥磚！</li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatJadenXgamer\" rel=\"nofollow\">JadenXGamer</a> 製作了自定義皂石和軟木音效！</li>\n<li>特別感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/Iamnotagenius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iamnotagenius</a> 允許我在 Fabric 版本中使用其配置代碼。<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fCreationsKeke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_1c7c6ef7-e88e-4f20-bb69-5db02edebb00.png\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fariana-bit.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_0e75891e-bc9e-4760-bfce-803c7a732b42.png\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_46654742-e7f0-4eeb-a776-1897f1625b2f.png\"></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
